Package: com.kolby.swiftpeek
Name: SwiftPeek
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.5.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Read-only SwiftUI + window-tree inspector. 0.5.4 adds an optional repeating window scan, because the two scans at 5s and 12s after launch cannot capture a screen you navigate to afterwards. 0.5.3 marks nodes the walk stopped at; 0.5.0 added layer and gradient colour. No hooks, no FOVO, every target defaults off. Debug tooling; not published.
Maintainer: ma6x9x
Author: ma6x9x
Section: Tweaks

